hadiths[25]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3425","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ne iman ka zaika chakh liya jo Allah ke Rab hone, Islam ke deen hone aur Muhammad ke Rasool hone par raazi hua."
"3426","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne maalon se apni izzaton ka difa karo."
"3427","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ka zabah karna ye hai ke tum use us ke munh par sataao."
"3428","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon ke bachchon ki kifalat Ibrahim karte hain."
"3429","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon ko chhor do ke amal karein; kyunke jannat sau darje hai, har do darjon ke darmiyan aasmaan aur zameen jitna faasla hai; aur Firdaus us ka aala-tareen darja aur darmiyani hissa hai; us ke upar Rahman ka Arsh hai; aur usi se jannat ki neherein phoot-ti hain; pas jab tum Allah se mango to us se Firdaus mango."
"3430","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe chhor do jab tak main tumhein chhorun; kyunke tum se pehle wale apne kasrat se sawal aur apne ambiya se ikhtilaf ki wajah se halaak hue; pas jab main tumhein kisi cheez ka hukm dun to us mein se jitna tum taaqat rakho lao; aur jab main tumhein kisi cheez se rokun to use chhor do."
"3431","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Janeen ka zabeeha us ki maa ka zabeeha hai."
"3432","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Murdaar ka zabeeha us ki dabaghat hai."
"3433","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har mashkeeze ka zabeeha us ki dabaghat hai."
"3434","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe namaz mein hamare paas sone ka tukra yaad aaya; maine napasand kiya ke wo hamare paas raat guzare; to maine us ki taqseem ka hukm diya."
"3435","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon ki zimma aik hai; pas agar un par zulm karne wali zulm kare to use na toro; kyunke har ghadar ke liye jhanda hoga jis se wo qayamat ke din pehchana jayega."
"3436","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aaj roza na rakhne wale ajr le gaye."
"3437","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ehl-e-hijrat us ki poori fazeelat le gaye."
"3438","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nabuwat chali gayi; pas mere baad nabuwat nahi magar khushkhabriyan hain: naik khwab jise aadmi dekhe ya us ke liye dekha jaye."
"3439","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nabuwat chali gayi aur khushkhabriyan baqi rahin."
"3440","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aurat ka daaman bhar ka hai."
"3441","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara daaman haath bhar ka hai."
"3442","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Makhiyan sab aag mein hongi siwa shehad ki makkhi ke."
"3443","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sona sone se, us ka kachcha aur sikka; chandi chandi se, us ki kachchi aur sikka; gehun gehun se, do mudd do mudd se; jau jau se, do mudd do mudd se; khajoor khajoor se, do mudd do mudd se; namak namak se, do mudd do mudd se; pas jo zyada de ya zyada mange us ne sood khaya. Aur sone ko chandi se bechne mein koi harj nahi jab chandi zyada ho, haath se haath ho; raha udhaar to nahi. Aur gehun ko jau se bechne mein koi harj nahi jab jau zyada ho, haath se haath ho; raha udhaar to nahi."
"3444","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sona sone se barabar barabar; chandi chandi se barabar barabar; khajoor khajoor se barabar barabar; gehun gehun se barabar barabar; namak namak se barabar barabar; jau jau se barabar barabar; pas jo zyada de ya zyada mange us ne sood khaya. Sone ko chandi se jaise chaho becho, haath se haath ho; aur jau ko khajoor se jaise chaho becho, haath se haath ho."
"3445","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sona sone se, chandi chandi se, gehun gehun se, jau jau se, khajoor khajoor se, namak namak se barabar barabar, tol mein barabar, haath se haath ho; phir jab ye qismein mukhtalif hon to jaise chaho becho jab haath se haath ho."
"3446","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sona sone se, chandi chandi se, gehun gehun se, jau jau se, khajoor khajoor se, namak namak se barabar barabar, haath se haath ho; pas jo zyada de ya zyada mange us ne sood khaya; aur lene aur dene wale barabar hain."
"3447","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sona sone se wazan se wazan, barabar barabar; chandi chandi se wazan se wazan, barabar barabar; pas jo zyada de ya zyada mange to wo sood hai."
"3448","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sona chaandi se sood hai magar haath se haath ho; gehun gehun se sood hai magar haath se haath ho; khajoor khajoor se sood hai magar haath se haath ho; jau jau se sood hai magar haath se haath ho."
"3449","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sona aur resham meri ummat ki aurton ke liye halal hain aur us ke mardon par haraam hain."
